      "created_at": "2025-09-08T06:55:04.448Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hi,</p>\n<p>I want to <strong>customize the ERPNext source code</strong>, run it locally on <strong>Windows</strong>, and later <strong>build my own Docker images</strong> for deployment.</p>\n<p>Right now, I can run ERPNext using the default <code>pwd.yml</code> file, but it only pulls prebuilt images from Docker Hub. I need a setup where I can:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Use the <strong>cloned ERPNext repo</strong> for local development.</li>\n<li>Test changes on my local machine.</li>\n<li>Build and host <strong>custom Docker images</strong> with my modified code.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Can someone guide me on the correct way to run ERPNext locally without using the default prebuilt images?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>",
